<div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2" role="navigation" aria-label="Spam Manager 功能">
  {% for key,label in {'overview':'總覽','scores':'評分與試算','maps':'全域名單','policies':'個別規則','impersonation':'防冒名','history':'掃描紀錄（無內文）','rejected':'郵件留存．看內文','outbound':'外寄攔截','update':'系統更新','verify':'設定驗證','backup':'備份與還原','geo':'登入地區'} %}
  {% if key == 'update' %}<span class="vr mx-1" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="small text-muted align-self-center me-1">維護</span>{% endif %}
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm {% if key == 'overview' %}btn-primary{% else %}btn-outline-secondary{% endif %}" data-sm-panel="{{ key }}" aria-pressed="{% if key == 'overview' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">{{ label }}</button>
  {% endfor %}
  <button type="button" id="sm-refresh" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ms-auto">重新讀取設定</button>
</div>
<div id="sm-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="small mb-2">正在讀取目前設定…</div>
<section data-sm-section="overview">
  <div class="card mb-2"><div class="card-body p-3">
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small" id="sm-summary"></div>
    <p class="small text-muted my-2">SMTP 來源檢查 → Rspamd 綜合評分／黑白名單／防冒名 → 病毒與其他強制動作 → Sieve 分類。全域門檻可能被個別規則覆寫。</p>
    <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm sm-table mb-0"><thead><tr><th>判斷層級</th><th>目前用途／關聯</th><th>調整位置</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td>一般綜合評分</td><td id="sm-threshold-summary">讀取中</td><td><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="scores">門檻／權重</button></td></tr>
      <tr><td>全域黑白名單</td><td>From／SMTP 寄件者加減分；收件者名單可直接接受或拒收。</td><td><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="maps">管理名單</button></td></tr>
      <tr><td>個別信箱／網域</td><td>寄件者名單與專屬門檻，優先序通常高於一般門檻。</td><td><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="policies">個別規則</button></td></tr>
      <tr><td>防冒名規則</td><td>比對顯示名稱及寄件信箱；命中後依此規則標記垃圾郵件。</td><td><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="impersonation">防冒名</button></td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>
    <div id="sm-relations" class="small text-muted mt-2"></div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2"><a class="small" href="/rspamd/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Rspamd 原生模組／統計</a><a class="small" href="/admin/system">Mailcow 系統設定／隔離區</a></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="card mb-2"><div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small">系統維護</div><div class="card-body p-2">
    <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm sm-table mb-0"><tbody>
      <tr><td style="width:7rem">系統更新</td><td id="sm-ov-update" class="small text-muted">讀取中…</td><td class="sm-actions"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="update">前往</button></td></tr>
      <tr><td>設定驗證</td><td id="sm-ov-verify" class="small text-muted">讀取中…</td><td class="sm-actions"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="verify">前往</button></td></tr>
      <tr><td>登入地區</td><td id="sm-ov-geo" class="small text-muted">讀取中…</td><td class="sm-actions"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="geo">前往</button></td></tr>
      <tr><td>備份與還原</td><td id="sm-ov-backup" class="small text-muted">讀取中…</td><td class="sm-actions"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-sm-go="backup">前往</button></td></tr>
    </tbody></table></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small">最近的變更前備份</div><div class="card-body p-2 small" id="sm-audit">尚無操作紀錄</div></div>
</section>
<section data-sm-section="update" hidden>
  <div class="card mb-2">
    <div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between"><span>更新 Mailcow</span><span class="d-flex gap-1"><button id="sm-update-verify-btn" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary py-0" title="重跑自訂設定、rspamd、容器與功能測試檢查，不會修改任何設定">重新驗證</button><button id="sm-update-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary py-0">重新讀取</button></span></div>
    <div class="card-body p-3">
      <div id="sm-update-status" class="small text-muted mb-2">讀取中…</div>
      <form id="sm-update-form" class="row g-2 align-items-end" data-cached-form="false">
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <label for="sm-update-pass" class="form-label small mb-1">更新密碼</label>
          <input id="sm-update-pass" type="password" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="在主機設定的更新密碼">
          <div class="small text-muted mt-1">與管理員登入密碼不同。由主機端驗證，網頁端不會儲存或比對。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-warning w-100">開始更新</button></div>
      </form>
      <div id="sm-update-progress" class="mt-3" hidden>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-baseline gap-2 mb-2">
          <strong class="small">執行進度</strong>
          <span id="sm-update-elapsed" class="small text-muted"></span>
          <span id="sm-update-version" class="small"></span>
        </div>
        <ol id="sm-update-steps" class="sm-steps list-unstyled mb-2"></ol>
        <div id="sm-update-problems" class="alert alert-danger small py-2 px-3 mb-2" hidden></div>
        <div id="sm-update-verify" class="small border rounded py-2 px-3 mb-2" hidden>
          <div id="sm-update-verify-head" class="fw-semibold mb-1"></div>
          <ul id="sm-update-verify-list" class="list-unstyled mb-1"></ul>
          <details><summary class="text-muted">驗證紀錄</summary><pre id="sm-update-verify-log" class="sm-log small border rounded p-2 mt-1 mb-0"></pre></details>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-3 small mb-1">
          <strong>更新內容（完整紀錄）</strong>
          <span id="sm-update-logmeta" class="text-muted"></span>
          <label class="form-check-label"><input id="sm-update-key" type="checkbox" class="form-check-input me-1">只看步驟與問題</label>
          <label class="form-check-label"><input id="sm-update-follow" type="checkbox" class="form-check-input me-1" checked>自動捲到最新</label>
        </div>
        <pre id="sm-update-log" class="sm-log small border rounded p-2 mb-0"></pre>
      </div>
      <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">更新會執行官方 <code>update.sh</code>，並自動重新套用本機自訂設定。<strong>過程中網頁與郵件服務會短暫中斷</strong>，期間此頁可能無法連線，完成後會自動顯示結果。請避開尖峰時段。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card mb-2">
    <div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
      <span>主機系統更新</span>
      <button id="sm-host-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary py-0">重新讀取</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body p-3">
      <div id="sm-host-status" class="small text-muted mb-2">讀取中…</div>
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small mb-2" id="sm-host-counts" hidden>
        <span>待更新：<strong id="sm-host-count">—</strong></span>
        <span>安全性：<strong id="sm-host-security">—</strong></span>
        <span>執行中核心：<code id="sm-host-kernel">—</code></span>
      </div>
      <div id="sm-host-deferred" class="small mb-2" hidden></div>
      <div id="sm-host-reboot" class="small mb-2" hidden></div>
      <form id="sm-host-form" class="row g-2 align-items-end" data-cached-form="false">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <label for="sm-host-pass" class="form-label small mb-1">更新密碼</label>
          <input id="sm-host-pass" type="password" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="與更新 mailcow 相同的那組密碼">
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"><button type="submit" name="apply" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary w-100">套用主機更新</button></div>
        <div class="col-md-3"><button type="button" id="sm-host-reboot-btn" class="btn btn-sm btn-danger w-100" disabled>重新開機</button></div>
      </form>
      <pre id="sm-host-log" class="small bg-body-tertiary border rounded p-2 mt-2 mb-0" style="max-height:200px;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap" hidden></pre>
      <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">一般套件與安全性更新（含新核心）<strong>每日自動安裝</strong>，因為 mailcow 跑在容器裡，主機函式庫不影響郵件。<code>docker.io</code>／<code>containerd</code>／<code>runc</code> 的升級會重啟容器執行環境，所以保留給你按「套用主機更新」；新核心要重開機才生效，所以重開機也是獨立的手動動作。<strong>兩者都會造成郵件短暫中斷，請避開尖峰時段。</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sm-section="verify" hidden>
  <div class="card mb-2">
    <div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
      <span>本機自訂設定狀態</span>
      <button id="sm-custom-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary py-0">重新檢查</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body p-2">
      <div id="sm-custom-status" class="small text-muted mb-2">讀取中…</div>
      <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm sm-table mb-0"><tbody id="sm-custom-rows"></tbody></table></div>
      <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">Mailcow 更新會以上游優先合併，可能覆蓋我們修改過的設定檔。更新後會自動重新套用；若仍顯示「已遺失」，可在主機執行 <code>helper-scripts/reapply-local-customizations.py --apply</code>。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sm-section="backup" hidden>
  <div class="card mb-2">
    <div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
      <span>NAS 連線設定</span>
      <button id="sm-nassetup-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary py-0">重新讀取</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body p-3">
      <div id="sm-nassetup-status" class="small text-muted mb-2">讀取中…</div>
      <div id="sm-nassetup-hint" class="alert alert-info small py-2 px-3 mb-2" hidden>
        還需要在主機執行一次下列指令，才能從這裡套用設定（它不會詢問任何事、也不含機密）：
        <pre class="mb-0 mt-1 p-2 bg-body-tertiary border rounded" style="white-space:pre-wrap">cd /path/to/mailcow-dockerized
sudo ./helper-scripts/setup-nas-webconfig.sh</pre>
        <span class="text-muted">網頁無法自行安裝主機層的 root agent —— 若可以，整套權限隔離就沒有意義了。下面的欄位可以先填好。</span>
      </div>
      <form id="sm-nassetup-form" data-cached-form="false">
        <div class="row g-2">
          <div class="col-md-5">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-host" class="form-label small mb-1">SMB 伺服器（IP 或主機名稱）</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-host" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="off" placeholder="192.168.1.50">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-share" class="form-label small mb-1">分享名稱</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-share" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="off" placeholder="backup">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-3">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-path" class="form-label small mb-1">子目錄（可留空）</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-path" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="off" placeholder="mailcow">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-user" class="form-label small mb-1">使用者名稱</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-user" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="off" placeholder="svc_mailbackup">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-pass" class="form-label small mb-1">NAS 密碼</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-pass" type="password" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="不會顯示、不會留存於網頁端">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-domain" class="form-label small mb-1">網域／工作群組（可留空）</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-domain" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-3">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-vers" class="form-label small mb-1">SMB 版本</label>
            <select id="sm-nassetup-vers" class="form-select form-select-sm"></select>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-3">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-keep" class="form-label small mb-1">保留份數</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-keep" type="number" min="1" max="99" value="8" class="form-control form-control-sm">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <label for="sm-nassetup-passphrase" class="form-label small mb-1">更新密碼</label>
            <input id="sm-nassetup-passphrase" type="password" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="與更新 mailcow 相同的那組密碼">
          </div>
          <div class="col-12"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">儲存並測試連線</button></div>
        </div>
      </form>
      <pre id="sm-nassetup-log" class="small bg-body-tertiary border rounded p-2 mt-2 mb-0" style="max-height:180px;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap" hidden></pre>
      <div class="alert alert-warning small py-2 px-3 mt-2 mb-0">
        儲存後主機會<strong>實際測試掛載與寫入</strong>，失敗不會留下半套設定。
        NAS 密碼只寫進主機的 <code>/etc/mailcow-nas/</code>（root 專屬、容器讀不到），
        <strong>網頁端不儲存、不回顯、不寫入稽核紀錄</strong>。
        <strong>備份加密金鑰不會顯示在網頁上</strong> —— 第一次設定成功後請在主機執行
        <code>sudo cat /etc/mailcow-nas/backup.key</code> 取出並離線保管，金鑰遺失將無法還原任何備份。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card mb-2">
    <div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
      <span>備份到 NAS</span>
      <button id="sm-nas-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary py-0">重新讀取</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body p-3">
      <div id="sm-nas-status" class="small text-muted mb-2">讀取中…</div>
      <dl class="row small mb-2" id="sm-nas-meta" hidden>
        <dt class="col-sm-3 fw-normal text-muted">備份目標</dt><dd class="col-sm-9 mb-1" id="sm-nas-target">—</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3 fw-normal text-muted">保留份數</dt><dd class="col-sm-9 mb-1" id="sm-nas-retention">—</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3 fw-normal text-muted">自動排程</dt><dd class="col-sm-9 mb-1" id="sm-nas-schedule">—</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3 fw-normal text-muted">加密</dt><dd class="col-sm-9 mb-0" id="sm-nas-encrypted">—</dd>
      </dl>
      <form id="sm-nas-form" class="row g-2 align-items-end" data-cached-form="false">
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <div class="small text-muted">備份不需要更新密碼（它只會在 NAS 上多一份加密副本，目標由主機固定）。但<strong>過程中 dovecot／postfix／redis／rspamd 會短暫停止</strong>，所以主機端限制至少間隔 5 分鐘才能再執行一次。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary w-100">立即備份</button></div>
      </form>
      <div class="table-responsive mt-2"><table class="table table-sm sm-table mb-0"><thead><tr><th>NAS 上的備份</th><th class="text-end">大小</th></tr></thead><tbody id="sm-nas-rows"><tr><td colspan="2" class="text-muted small">尚無資料</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      <form id="sm-nas-notify-form" class="row g-2 align-items-end mt-2" data-cached-form="false">
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <label for="sm-nas-notify" class="form-label small mb-1">備份失敗通知收件人</label>
          <input id="sm-nas-notify" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="留空則不寄送通知">
          <div class="small text-muted mt-1">以逗號分隔，最多 5 個。留空只會關閉通知，備份仍會照排程執行。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary w-100">儲存收件人</button></div>
      </form>
      <pre id="sm-nas-log" class="small bg-body-tertiary border rounded p-2 mt-2 mb-0" style="max-height:200px;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap" hidden></pre>
      <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">SMB 密碼只存在主機（<code>/etc/mailcow-nas/</code>，root 專屬），網頁看不到也無法更改備份目標 —— 這也是備份不需要密碼的原因。分享只在備份期間掛載，結束即卸載。<strong>備份期間 dovecot／postfix／redis／rspamd 會短暫停止。</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card mb-2 border-danger-subtle">
    <div class="card-header py-2 px-3 small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
      <span class="text-danger">從 NAS 還原</span>
      <button id="sm-restore-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary py-0">重新讀取</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body p-3">
      <div id="sm-restore-status" class="small text-muted mb-2">讀取中…</div>
      <div class="alert alert-warning small py-2 px-3 mb-2">
        <strong>還原會覆蓋線上資料，且無法復原。</strong>
        網頁只能還原設定類元件；<strong>信件（vmail）與加密金鑰（crypt）必須在主機執行</strong>，以免一次誤操作蓋掉所有信箱。
        還原前會自動快照目前的 mysql 與 redis，供失敗時退回。
      </div>
      <form id="sm-restore-form" data-cached-form="false">
        <div class="row g-2">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <label for="sm-restore-backup" class="form-label small mb-1">要還原的備份</label>
            <select id="sm-restore-backup" class="form-select form-select-sm"><option value="">（尚無備份）</option></select>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <label class="form-label small mb-1">要還原的元件</label>
            <div id="sm-restore-components" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small pt-1"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <label for="sm-restore-confirm" class="form-label small mb-1">確認：請完整輸入上面的備份名稱</label>
            <input id="sm-restore-confirm" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="off" placeholder="mailcow-…">
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <label for="sm-restore-pass" class="form-label small mb-1">更新密碼</label>
            <input id="sm-restore-pass" type="password" class="form-control form-control-sm" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="與更新按鈕相同的那組密碼">
          </div>
          <div class="col-12"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-danger">開始還原</button></div>
        </div>
      </form>
      <pre id="sm-restore-log" class="small bg-body-tertiary border rounded p-2 mt-2 mb-0" style="max-height:200px;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap" hidden></pre>
      <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">還原前會先驗證 SHA256 與壓縮檔完整性，驗證不過就不會動到任何資料。還原 mysql 會停止整個 stack 並依備份的 <code>mailcow.conf</code> 對齊資料庫參數（原檔會另存備份）。信件還原請在主機執行：<code>sudo ./helper-scripts/mailcow-nas-restore.sh --backup &lt;名稱&gt; --components "vmail crypt" --allow-mail</code></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
