          </div>
          <div class="mt-3">
            <div class="small text-muted mb-1">將寫入</div>
            <div id="sm-list-target" class="small fw-semibold"></div>
            <pre id="sm-list-preview" class="small border rounded p-2 mt-1 mb-1" style="white-space:pre-wrap"></pre>
            <div id="sm-list-effect" class="small text-muted"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">寄件者取自隔離區紀錄，不是從這個畫面輸入的，所以不會誤加到其他地址。加入後 Rspamd 會依原生動態名單機制重新載入，不必重啟服務；這筆變更會記在稽核紀錄，之後可在「全域名單」或「個別規則」分頁移除。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer py-2">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">取消</button>
          <button type="button" id="sm-list-save" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">加入名單</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sm-section="outbound" hidden>
  <div class="card mb-2"><div class="card-body p-3">
    <form id="sm-outbound-notify-form" class="row g-2 align-items-end" data-cached-form="false">
      <div class="col-md-9"><label for="sm-outbound-notify" class="form-label small mb-1">攔截通知收件人</label><input id="sm-outbound-notify" class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="user@example.invalid" aria-describedby="sm-outbound-notify-help"><div id="sm-outbound-notify-help" class="small text-muted mt-1">有外寄郵件被攔截時寄通知到這些信箱，可用逗號分隔，最多 5 個。</div></div>
      <div class="col-md-3"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary w-100">儲存通知設定</button></div>
    </form>
  </div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-body p-3">
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-2"><h2 class="h6 mb-0">往外寄被攔截的郵件</h2><input id="sm-outbound-search" type="search" class="form-control form-control-sm flex-grow-1" style="width:200px" placeholder="搜尋寄件者、收件者、主旨" aria-label="搜尋外寄攔截"><button id="sm-outbound-refresh" type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">更新清單</button></div>
    <div id="sm-outbound-status" class="small text-muted mb-2"></div>
    <div class="table-responsive sm-scroll"><table class="table table-sm sm-table mb-0"><thead><tr><th>時間</th><th>寄件者 → 外部收件者／主旨</th><th>分數</th><th class="sm-actions">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="sm-outbound-rows"><tr><td colspan="4" class="small text-muted">讀取中…</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">你們的人往外寄、但被拒收的郵件（例如誤判）會留存於此，保留 30 天。<strong>「放行」會把原信寄給外部收件人，略過當初的攔截</strong>，請務必先確認郵件安全；病毒命中者放行需額外確認。「刪除」則不寄出。<strong>SMTP 連線階段拒收不會在此</strong>。</p>
  </div></div>
</section>
